Z||000024||Fierochic88||08-10-2001||05:31 PM||||Ahhh...I'll just make this one big post  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Ski - Yeah the car ran fine the whole way home and ever since...hasn't used any oil!  Strange indeed...I will keep you posted...we could always put that engine in my 85 GT to test it out while we're rebuilding the other one!<P>Wild 86:  Glad to see you finally made it!  I guess Lisa's and my pestering finally got to you!<P><BR>Vonnie:  Nothing like getting flagged by your parents!  Though you gotta teach ski "better manners!"  throwing food is wasteful!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Lar:  Those pics better be censored!  Unlike the other picture the entire United States soon will see!<P>BlueLight:  Keep whatever you're pulling out just where it is!  You'll be better off that way!<P><BR>jennifer||||reg||1
Z||000025||LZeitgeist||08-10-2001||06:37 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Jennifer sez:<BR>Lar: Those pics better be censored! Unlike the other picture the entire United States soon will see!<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hey Lar... that sounds like a threat.. are you just gonna sit there and take that kind of abuse? I think I'd post all the uncensored ones first, and *then* post the nice ones...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><BR>BlueLight: Keep whatever you're pulling out just where it is! You'll be better off that way!<BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Ohhhhhh, I'm not touching *that* statement with a ten-foot keyboard... nope, nopenopenope... 8)<BR><P>------------------<BR>Patrick W. Heinske  --  LZeitgeist@aol.com<BR>1988 Red Fiero Formula<BR>- 1st Place - Stock Coupe - FOCOSEVA 2000<BR>- 3rd Place - Stock Formula - FOCOA Nat'l 2001||||reg||1
