Z||000030||Fierochic88||08-11-2001||07:16 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by skitime:<BR><B>Hey Jen, Greetings from Novia Scotia. We are visiting Jelly 2M8 right now. He is the man for Fieros here.  We are going to a show with him tomorrow to show his three Fieros.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hope you guys are enjoying your visit!  Don't worry Heather and I haven't thrown TOO many huge parties :-)  JK...hopefully we're going to see American Pie 2 tomorrow!  Will you guys be home by the 25th?<P>Jennifer<P>||||reg||1
Z||000031||CoolBlue87GT||08-11-2001||10:59 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fierochic88:<BR><B>I can't find my car on CoolBlue's page yet!  Guess I gotta keep looking!  <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>hey there Jennifer,<P>I see your car on the page I set up.  Try again !<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/009385.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/009385.html</A> <P>It was great seeing everyone again.  I enjoyed talking with old & making new friends.<P>I spoke with Phil after he judged the Historic class. Wow, can he talk Fiero's !<P>He showed me a few places where mine was spotless, and looked over and saw not many cars had these spaces detailed. 8&lt; )  He told me it was cleaner the one he has on display back home.  <P>(of course, the trip up had made the car filthy, and the clean up took some time, I'm glad he noticed)<P>Has anyone ever noticed if an alarm system was ever a factory option on any years?  <P>Also, I wonder how many cars still had there orignal factory tires ?  I know of two cars that did.<P>Last question, I spent so much time shooting everyone's car, I only got one or two of mine. Does anyone have any shots of mine ?<P>If so, please post it on the above address. I'd really like to have a few more shots. Thanks.<p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 08-11-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000032||skitime||08-12-2001||08:07 AM||||Yes we will be back by next Monday or Tuesday.  Hope all is well with your family.||||reg||1
